# Mainnet-beta build (`npm run build` / `deploy:production`) — the ONLY build ever deployed to
# otchub.dev/hub (see ../wrangler.jsonc `env.production`). These are safe-to-commit fallback
# defaults (public RPC + the program id, both already public knowledge on-chain) so a fresh
# clone / CI without secrets still builds a correct mainnet-beta bundle, never a devnet one.
#
# Real deploys should override VITE_HUB_RPC_URL with a paid RPC (e.g. Helius) in
# `.env.production.local` (gitignored, never committed — the key ships in the browser bundle,
# so allowlist otchub.dev in the provider's dashboard). Vite loads `.env.production.local`
# last, so it wins over the defaults below without needing to duplicate the other values.
VITE_HUB_RPC_URL=https://api.mainnet-beta.solana.com
VITE_HUB_CLUSTER=mainnet-beta
VITE_HUB_PROGRAM_ID=7c5oPs9GvX8vrC5jVFketNx1ZLuPs7HeH8Qc4XJx7b7i
